  "description": "And a quick review of what we did in 2025",
  "body_html": "<p>If you feel like you missed something this week… you didn’t.<br>It was one of the quietest weeks in the market all year.</p><p>That said—don’t get comfortable. Markets tend to get busy <em>after</em> they’re slow. It’s a constant cycle.</p><h3>How did we do this year?</h3><p>Honestly? Pretty good.</p><p>All positions are updated regularly, and everything is public every day, so I don’t feel the need for a big end-of-year recap. You can see all the 2025 trades below.</p><p>Someone asked me why my end-of-year return was “only” <strong>29%</strong> for 2025, especially since 2024 was <strong>142%</strong>.</p><p>But let me ask you something…<br><strong>Does that actually matter?</strong></p><p>Think about it.</p><h3>A quick example</h3><p><strong>Person A</strong></p><ul><li><p>Makes <strong>500%</strong> on a <strong>$1,000</strong> account</p></li><li><p>Account grows to <strong>$6,000</strong></p></li><li><p>Total profit: <strong>$5,000</strong></p></li></ul><p><strong>Person B</strong></p><ul><li><p>Makes <strong>10%</strong> on a <strong>$1,000,000</strong> account</p></li><li><p>Account grows to <strong>$1,100,000</strong></p></li><li><p>Total profit: <strong>$100,000</strong></p></li></ul><p>Both did great. Seriously no knock on Person A at all. By percentage, they crushed it.</p><p>But Person B made far more <em>actual</em> money.</p><p>That’s why flexing end-of-year percentages without context is kind of pointless. Everyone’s situation is different.</p><h3>What actually matters</h3><p>That I:</p><ul><li><p>Pick winning stocks more often than not</p></li><li><p>Help you either <strong>make money</strong> or <strong>protect money</strong></p></li></ul><p>And we did that ✅</p><h3>Quick StockTok metrics for the year</h3><ul><li><p><strong>69.23%</strong> of stock picks were correct</p></li><li><p><strong>Largest win:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Roblox: <strong>+61%</strong></p></li><li><p>Rigetti: <strong>+54%</strong></p></li><li><p>Both were compounded (added to while rising)</p></li><li><p>Those two trades alone made about <strong>$32,000</strong></p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Largest loss:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Airship AI: <strong>-42%</strong></p></li><li><p>Initial position was about $10k → loss around <strong>$4,200</strong></p></li><li><p>QS earlier in the year: <strong>-25%</strong> (I was too early)</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Net total PnL:</strong> <strong>314%</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Average trade PnL:</strong> <strong>7.09%</strong></p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bXn2!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F11cc68fc-4636-4ca5-bfcc-bb6404392bd2_1132x1638.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bXn2!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F11cc68fc-4636-4ca5-bfcc-bb6404392bd2_1132x1638.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bXn2!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F11cc68fc-4636-4ca5-bfcc-bb6404392bd2_1132x1638.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bXn2!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F11cc68fc-4636-4ca5-bfcc-bb6404392bd2_1132x1638.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bXn2!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F11cc68fc-4636-4ca5-bfcc-bb6404392bd2_1132x1638.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bXn2!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F11cc68fc-4636-4ca5-bfcc-bb6404392bd2_1132x1638.png\" width=\"1132\" height=\"1638\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/11cc68fc-4636-4ca5-bfcc-bb6404392bd2_1132x1638.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1638,&quot;width&quot;:1132,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:865977,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/183250316?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3e9be68b-74d0-4dbf-a383-ab42bf2cc89c_1142x1638.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bXn2!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F11cc68fc-4636-4ca5-bfcc-bb6404392bd2_1132x1638.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bXn2!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F11cc68fc-4636-4ca5-bfcc-bb6404392bd2_1132x1638.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bXn2!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F11cc68fc-4636-4ca5-bfcc-bb6404392bd2_1132x1638.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bXn2!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F11cc68fc-4636-4ca5-bfcc-bb6404392bd2_1132x1638.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h4>Here’s the key takeaway:</h4><p>👉 <strong>Winners massively outweighed losers </strong>because we <strong>added to winners</strong>, not losers.</p><p>By <em>not</em> dollar-cost averaging down, the losing trades didn’t bleed the portfolio. </p><h3>Biggest lesson of 2025</h3><p><strong>Be more aggressive adding to winners.</strong></p><p>You already know I follow Mark Minervini closely, and I combine that with Tom Hougaard’s approach of compounding winners.</p><p>Where I messed up this year was being <em>too conservative</em>.</p><p>For example:</p><ul><li><p>I’d start with <strong>$10k</strong></p></li><li><p>Then add another <strong>$10k</strong></p></li><li><p>Then another <strong>$10k</strong></p></li></ul><p>That’s fine.</p><p>But Tom would likely do something like:</p><ul><li><p>$10k initial</p></li><li><p>Add <strong>$20k</strong></p></li><li><p>Then add <strong>$40k</strong></p></li></ul><p>And yes… he makes way more.</p><p>When I look back at my biggest winners, if I had done that, the <em>dollar</em> gains would have been significantly higher.</p><p>Is it scary? Absolutely.<br>But that’s something I need to get more comfortable with.</p><p>I’m human. I’m good at picking stocks—but I need to squeeze more juice out of the winners.</p><p>I’m sharing this because it’s a lesson I’m actively learning, and maybe it helps you too. Whether you’ve been trading for one month or thirty years, we’re always refining the process.</p><h3>Final note</h3><p>This week was extremely quiet. Santa’s “rally” turned into Santa’s <strong>slumber</strong> 😴</p><p>I’m mostly waiting for current positions to move further into profit before adding anything new. <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-last-stock-market-update-of-2025\">Here was the last stock market update</a> for this week.</p><p>Stay tuned! We will have another great year in 2026, regardless if the market goes up or down.</p><p>Have a great weekend, and I’ll see you all bright and early Monday morning. Thanks for stopping by! </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-playbook-everything?r=4z8lgl\">The StockTok Playbook</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p></p>",
